      "id": "q1",
      "type": "recall",
      "q": "What does \"clear and conspicuous\" mean in the FTC's 2023 Endorsement Guides?",
      "a": "Difficult to miss and easily understandable by ordinary consumers.",
      "anchor": "#disclosure-the-law",
      "origin": "ai",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "explain",
      "q": "Why are follower counts a poor basis for choosing creators?",
      "a": "They say nothing about audience fit or genuine engagement, and can be inflated by bought followers.",
      "anchor": "#choosing-creators",
      "origin": "ai",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "type": "recall",
      "q": "What should an influencer agreement cover?",
      "a": "Deliverables, creative freedom and approval, disclosure, payment, usage rights, exclusivity and reporting.",
      "anchor": "#agreements",
      "origin": "ai",
      "reviewed": false
